    "basmil_image_text_MKmyLX": {
      "type": "basmil-image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "content_LHiw7R": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our <brown>Story</brown>",
            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<p>Our journey started from the heart of the Himalayas, where the air is thin, and the spirit of resilience thrives. Our inspiration is drawn from the indomitable spirit of Sherpas and many high-altitude communities in the Himalayas, who have been using <a href=\"https://everestshilajit.com/pages/shilajit-complete-guide\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"shilajit\">shilajit</a> for centuries due to its believed benefits in promoting energy, endurance, and overall health. Genuine Shilajit takes millions of years to form and is only found trapped within rocky cliffs at very high altitudes and in remote regions of the Himalayas. </p><p>In 2016, exploring the breathtaking landscapes of Nepal, we collected the finest Shilajit from all the regions. Since then, we have been dedicated to relentless research, delving into the origins of Shilajit and fostering connections with tribes who have masterfully extracted this resin through generations. We work in collaboration with Sherpas and tribal communities of Solukhumbu, Dolpa and Darchula, where we meticulously sourced from carefully chosen harvesters and purified using advanced, precise methods to ensure both purity and potency. </p><p>We created Everest Shiljait to provide authentic shiljait and have continued to travel across nepal to search for the finest shilajit with unparalleled efficacy and integrity. We have partnered with renowned Ayurvedic doctors to create effective, genuine formulas and products using only the highest quality, ethically sourced from Nepal.</p><p>When it comes to <a href=\"https://everestshilajit.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Shilajit Nepal\">shilajit, Nepal</a> is the only place to find the finest shilajit in the world!</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": ""
          }
        },
