    "basmil_image_text_jmyjmd": {
      "type": "basmil-image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "content_eLqhFN": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p class=\"font-sans hidden\">ABOUT US</p>\nOur <brown>Source</brown>",
            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<p>We personally source our Shilajit from a remote Himalayan region of Nepal, where there are the world's highest peaks, like Mount Everest, Dhaulagiri II, and Api Himal. The local community of these regions have been hand collecting raw shilajit from this region for centuries and has learned, through ancestral knowledge passed down to each generation, how to identify original gold grade shilajit. </p><p>The raw Shilajit originates at altitudes between 16,000 and 18,000 feet. <a href=\"https://everestshilajit.com/collections/all\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"pure himalayan shilajit\">Pure Himalayan Shilajit</a> from this particular region and altitude is highly prized by Ayurvedic specialists and is considered to possess the greatest healing power.</p><p>After collection, our Shilajit is purified with filtered spring water, and laboratory tested for safety. See our “Safety and Purity” section for links to our most recent lab tests.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": ""
          }
        },
