    "basmil_image_text_3pFhta": {
      "type": "basmil-image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "content_QixhUn": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Story Behind<brown> Everest Shilajit</brown>",
            "subtitle": "FOUNDER",
            "description": "<p>Growing up in Nepal, the Himalayas were more than just a backdrop to my life, they were a source of wonder, wisdom, and healing.</p><p>I have always believed in the healing power of nature. As a child, my fondest memories were of my father bringing raw shilajit to gift his friends as a souvenir from his home. Over the years, I developed a deep passion for strength training and endurance, but as a vegetarian, finding the right supplement was essential. Shilajit became my go-to fueling my energy, focus, and resilience.</p><p>During a trip to my hometown, Darchula, I discovered that the world's finest Shilajit was being exported and mislabeled as Indian origin. That moment hit my emotions and from that day I traveled deep into the Himalayas, connected with local harvesters, and learned everything I could do about sourcing and purifying Shilajit the right way with a mission to bring pure, authentic Himalayan Shilajit to the world.</p><p>Everest Shilajit is more than a brand; it’s a promise of quality, sustainability, and honoring ancestors' wisdom.</p><p>I hope it brings you the same strength and vitality it has given me.</p><p><strong>Pragya Mahara<br/></strong>Founder, Everest Shilajit</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": ""
          }
        },
