            "icon_alt_text": "Icon Description",
            "icon_title": "Sourced from Everest Region",
            "icon_description": "We extracted our shilajit from the Himalayan mountains of Nepal between the altitudes of 16,000 – 18,000 feet where the terrain is rich in minerals and robust medicine. The sticky tar formed is a result of the breakdown of plants and minerals over time, and fulvic acid along with natural bioactive compounds are decomposed. The local people of the Himalayan regions harvest these at a rich high altitude containing over 85 trace minerals guaranteeing their maximum purity and effectiveness.",
            "btn_title": "",
            "btn_link": ""
          }
        },
