8453D\"></path>\n</svg>",
            "icon_alt_text": "",
            "icon_title": "Lab Tested &amp; Certified",
            "icon_description": "We test every batch of Shilajit at the Nepal Government Labs, and an American, FDA registered, GMP certified, independent, third party laboratory. California’s Prop 65 is considered to be the toughest regulations available when it comes to heavy metal testing. The same goes for us, while many brands are focused on hasty, mass production, we spend 60 to 90 days preparing SHILAJIT at low heat. Through our minimal production, we sell a limited amount of a hundred jars every month.",
            "btn_title": "",
            "btn_link": ""
