            "icon_description": "We package and process our Shilajit in GMP-certified facilities where we pay special attention to our equipment, storage facilities, and the implementation of HACCP protocols.\nThese steps are integral for preserving the quality of our Shilajit and guaranteeing its safety throughout the production cycle. Air quality, temperature, and humidity are tightly controlled for optimal production environments. We guarantee that every jar of our Shilajit is protected in a sealed, food-grade, non-BPA leaching, non-reactive container upon arrival, making it safe and effective.",
