            "icon_title": "85+ Traced Minerals",
            "icon_description": "Shilajit contains 85+ trace minerals in their ionic form and hence are extremely bioavailable. The essential minerals Calcium, Magnesium, Potassium, Sodium, Phosphorus, and Sulfur are required for bone strength, contraction and relaxation of muscles, and energy production. It also has Iron, Zinc, Copper, Manganese, Chromium, Selenium, Molybdenum, Iodine, Cobalt, Boron, Fluoride, Vanadium, Nickel, and Silicon to support immunity, metabolism, thyroid, and cleansing functions.",
