            "icon_alt_text": "",
            "icon_title": "Fair Trade Community",
            "icon_description": "At Everest Shilajit, we believe in ethical sourcing and sustainable trade practices that support the Himalayan communities. Our commitment to Fair Trade ensures that the hardworking himalayan harvesters receive fair wages, safe working conditions, and community support. By working directly with local collectors, we preserve traditional knowledge while promoting environmental conservation. Each purchase supports education, healthcare, and sustainable livelihoods in the region, fostering a stronger, self-sufficient community.",
